<file:///Users/oerc0042/NDocuments/git/isa-api/isa-cookbook/content/notebooks/MTBLS4381_183928_compressed_files/isa-rdf.json#study_factor/ed8d35b0-dcfb-4f03-9e7e-66a683185243> a <http://schema.orgProperty/> ;
